  NodeNumber: 
  Background: {fileID: 0}
  narrativeText: "Now let me tell you this: if you walk to the deepest part of the
    cavern, to the very source from which all the outward-growing flesh emerges,
    you will see a woman\u2019s face. You may even recognize her. She was once one
    of your neighbors too. I will not tell you why she became like this, but I will
    tell you that if you go up to her and reach your hand into her mouth, you will
    find an elixir. Swallow it, and you will become \u201Csomething other than human.\u201D
    You will grow stronger and sharper, will no longer feel hunger, and will not
    become a monster like your neighbors\u2014unless you fail to obtain the next
    elixir. In order to stay alive, you will have no choice but to walk into that
    fog and search for another one."
  choices:
